              "The candidate removes the prespec verbs from the engine, the wrapper route, the help text, the manifest rows and the architecture ring consistently. Every deleted symbol is in the deleted prespec packages or in cmd/prespec.go and cmd/prespec_test.go, and the patch shows no remaining reference to them.",
